# Build context = the repository root (infra/docker/docker-compose.prod.yml, service `web`).
# An allowlist: everything else in the repository (services, team, state, docs, the
# owner's identity root, any .env) never reaches the build daemon, let alone the image.
*
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!apps/web/**
# The one file outside the package the web shell imports (app/lib/voice/session-contract.ts):
# the realtime session contract, bundled into the client at build time.
!packages/protocol/realtime-session-contract.json
# ...except what must never ride along from the web package.
apps/web/node_modules
apps/web/.next
apps/web/tests
apps/web/preview
apps/web/AGENTS.md
apps/web/**/.env
apps/web/**/.env.*
apps/web/**/*.key
apps/web/**/*.pem
apps/web/tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
